#: resources/menta-install.glade.h:5
msgid "System"
msgstr ""

#: resources/menta-install.glade.h:6
msgid ""
"System packages are managed by your Linux distribution and use shared "
"libraries and resources."
msgstr ""

#: resources/menta-install.glade.h:7
msgid ""
"They are safe, small and stable. They receive bug fixes and security updates "
"but no newer versions."
msgstr ""

#: resources/menta-install.glade.h:8
msgid "Flatpak"
msgstr ""

#: resources/menta-install.glade.h:9
msgid ""
"Flatpaks are maintained and updated directly by their owner, with no control "
"from your Linux distribution. They usually provide the most up to date "
"version."
msgstr ""

#: resources/menta-install.glade.h:10
msgid ""
"They take more disk space. Their security is not guaranteed by your Linux "
"distribution, but by the Flatpak maintainer. It's essential you trust the "
"maintainer before installing a Flatpak."
msgstr ""

